# Arc: Other | Scene: AlfredPath

translate ja strings:

    old "A man who thought that only the decay of old age remained, who now instead found a young and willing woman, again before him."
    new "老いによる朽ち残ししかないと信じていた男が、今度は若い女を前にした。"

    old "A new lease on life."
    new "人生の新しい章。"

    old "A loud groan filled the room."
    new "部屋中に大きなうめき声が響いた。"

    old "A man who expected to find a willing woman, but not this eager whore."
    new "男が求むのは同意する女であり、このほど欲しがるスケベ女ではなかった。"

    old "A last few drops of semen, landing on her tongue."
    new "最後の数滴の精子が、彼女の舌に落ちる。"

    old "A complicated flurry of emotions rocked her body as she began to slowly finger herself."
    new "複雑な感情の嵐が体を揺さぶり、彼女はゆっくりと指で自分自身を弄り始めた。"

    old "A frenzied back and forth."
    new "混乱した行き来。"

    old "A man who desired her. Provided for her."
    new "彼女を欲し、世話になった男だ。"

    old "A man my age can only be so angry when he's just finished fucking a girl like you."
    new "男なら、そんな女とセックスした直後でも、これほど怒れるはずがない。"

    old "A lie. But Sarah wasn't about to betray the only ally she had left by revealing that."
    new "嘘だ。だが、サラは残された唯一の味方を裏切るわけにはいかなかった。"

    old "A bull that could protect her in a world of lions."
    new "ライオンが跋扈する世界で、彼女を護る雄牛。"

    old "A lust in his eyes unlike any she had seen before."
    new "彼の瞳には、彼女がこれまで見たことのないような欲望が宿っていた。"

    old "A boy, as she had hoped it would be."
    new "男の子、それが望んでいた通りだ。"

    old "A man that had been given a second life and wasted not a minute of it."
    new "誰にも気にならない男が、二度目の人生を与えられ、その一秒も無駄にせず生きた。"

    old "A man who had lost everything, and possessed nothing."
    new "すべてを失い、何も持たぬ男。"

    old "A kingdom of a different kind, she thought as she smiled and thought of her bull."
    new "異国の王国だ、と彼女は微笑みながら牛を想った。"
